  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Applying, Snell's law <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>μsin</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mtext>&nbsp;constant&nbsp;</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>, we have<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM006721_AnsExp1_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 199px;\" /><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>μ</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>sin i</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <msub> <mi>μ</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>sin i</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi>glass</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&nbsp;∴&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mtext>air</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>°</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&nbsp;∴&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>90</mn><mo>°</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴ &nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mtext>g</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>",
